OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue warning after
OL,4,Afireworks disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have warned that firm action
OL,7,Fwill be taken against anyone involved
OL,8,Fin fireworks-related disorder,
OL,9,Ffollowing serious incidents in
OL,10,FBirmingham during Bonfire Night last
OL,11,Fyear.
OL,13,FWest Midlands Police said a "robust"
OL,14,Fplan was in place, with extra officers
OL,15,Fto be deployed at key locations to
OL,16,Fprevent a repeat of last year's
OL,17,Fviolence.
OL,19,FOn 6 November, 21 people were arrested
OL,20,Fafter officers were attacked with
OL,21,Ffireworks on Dale End and Staniforth
OL,22,FStreet.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
